# Boards this example is built and gated for, one per line. rt1176 is the
# MIMXRT1170-EVKB. nosh is the Nosh board: the same RT1176 with an SGTL5000 codec
# on LPI2C5 (the sketch's ARDUINO_NOSH arm) and the microSD on USDHC2; its gate
# boots the EVKB machine through gate-lib's nosh arm (sdram-size=128M) and needs
# a qemu2 with the SGTL5000 stub at 0x0A on LPI2C5 (fbbd5fd, 2026-11-07).
rt1176
nosh
